<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Jan global trade deficit 115.8 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal Jan global trade deficit 115.8 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's global trade deficit rose to 115.8 billion escudos in January from 107.7 billion in same period last year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>			  Jan 97    Jan 96</p>
<p> Overall balance    -115.8     -107.7</p>
<p> Imports		 415.4	412.6</p>
<p> Exports		 299.6	304.9</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos. A minus sign denotes a deficit. -- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
